ants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIDA SEISAKUSHO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWANISHI NORIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGURI TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHSHITA MINORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIDA CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWANISHI, NORIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGURI, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHSHITA, MINORU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWANISHI NORIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGURI TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHSHITA MINORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWANISHI, NORIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGURI, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHSHITA, MINORU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A packaging apparatus capable of packaging with a film an article to be packaged, which is heaped on a tray, by a top seal system without preparing a die for every tray different in shape and size. A packaging apparatus (1) is an apparatus which, for a tray (T) having on its upper face a flange and an opening surrounded by the flange, covers the opening with a film (Fm) in a state that an article to be packaged is accommodated in the tray (T) and welds the film (Fm) to the flange. The packaging apparatus (1) is provided with rollers (3) and a roller turning mechanism (8). The roller (3) contacts with a part of the flange of the tray (T) from above the film (Fm), and its face contacting with the tray (T) is slanted with respect to a horizontal plane. The roller turning mechanism (8) turns and moves the rollers (3).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un appareil d'emballage pouvant emballer avec un film un article à emballer, celui-ci étant posé sur un plateau, par un système de soudure supérieur sans préparer une nouvelle matrice de forme et de taille différente pour chaque plateau. Cet appareil (1) d'emballage est un appareil qui, pour un plateau (T) présentant sur sa surface supérieure un bord et une ouverture entourée par le bord, recouvre l'ouverture avec un film (Fm) de façon à ce que l'article à emballer soit disposé sur le plateau (T) et soude le film (Fm) au bord. Cet appareil (1) d'emballage comporte des roues (3) et un mécanisme (8) de rotation de roues. La roue (3) vient en contact avec une partie du bord du plateau (T) au-dessus du film (Fm), sa face en contact avec le plateau (T) étant inclinée par rapport à un plan horizontal. Le mécanisme (8) de rotation de roues tourne et déplace les roues.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights